; =============================================================================
; ALB Math Standard Library
; Module: math
; Version: 0.0.6
; Usage: (use "math")
; =============================================================================
;
; Submodules (auto-loaded by interpreter):
;   01-constants.alb     - PI, E, TAU, PHI, INF
;   02-interpolation.alb - lerp, inverse-lerp, remap
;   03-trig.alb          - deg->rad, rad->deg
;   04-random.alb        - rand-float, rand-int, rand-bool
;   05-utility.alb       - sign, lerp-angle
;   06-vector.alb        - vec2-dot, vec2-len, vec2-dist, vec2-norm
;
; All functions are available after (use "math").
; =============================================================================
